    {
      "text": "Modifying Zscaler Zero Trust Gateway groups or viewing individual Zero Trust Gateways are some of the tasks you can complete after deployment."
    },
    {
      "text": "To edit or view a Zero Trust Gateway:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Zero Trust Cloud > Cloud Connector > Cloud Connector Groups.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          48
        ],
        [
          51,
          66
        ],
        [
          69,
          91
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Cloud Connector Groups page, locate the Zero Trust Gateway group or individual Zero Trust Gateway you want to modify or view and click the Edit or View icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          146,
          150
        ],
        [
          154,
          158
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Zero Trust Gateway group",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "3. In the Edit Group window, you can configure or view the following:",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Tunnel Information section, under ZIA Tunnel Mode, select Unencrypted UDP or DTLS",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          25
        ],
        [
          41,
          56
        ],
        [
          65,
          80
        ],
        [
          84,
          88
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Group Information section, you can view:",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          24
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: The name of the Zero Trust Gateway group",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Location Name: The location from where your Zero Trust Gateway group was deployed",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "4. Click Save and activate the change.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          9,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Individual Zero Trust Gateway",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Edit Group window, you can view the following:",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          17
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Tunnel Information section, the ZIA Tunnel Mode set as Unencrypted UDP or DTLS.",
